{"answeredBy":"Hamza (via web)","answers":{"Q-1":"Forward only, one step at a time (Received→Confirmed→Picking→Out for delivery→Delivered); Cancelled only from Received or Confirmed","Q-2":"Shared with all users of the same customer company","Q-3":"Its users can't sign in until the company is reactivated; history is kept","Q-4":"Yes: stock is shown only as information (stock is only updated nightly), and staff deal with shortfalls at confirmation","Q-5":"Only before it is Confirmed, the same as editing","Q-6":"Admins only, on the Audit history screen; kept for 7 years like orders","Q-7":"Customer users can cancel only before Staff start processing it; Staff can cancel until dispatch","Q-8":"Admin only: products, price lists, staff/admin users and the audit view. Staff: orders, customers and customer users","Q-9":"Staff and Admin set it on each invoice: Unpaid / Paid"},"asked":[{"category":"scope","id":"Q-1","impact":3,"impactReason":"Status changes trigger emails and create invoices.","options":["Forward only, one step at a time (Received→Confirmed→Picking→Out for delivery→Delivered); Cancelled only from Received or Confirmed","Staff may set any status at any time","Forward only, but steps can be skipped"],"reason":"Delivered creates the invoice, so a strict order stops accidental or duplicate invoices.","recommended":"Forward only, one step at a time (Received→Confirmed→Picking→Out for delivery→Delivered); Cancelled only from Received or Confirmed","score":6,"spans":["I-14","I-16"],"text":"Do staff need to move orders through the statuses in a fixed order, and can they go backwards?","uncertainty":2},{"category":"roles","id":"Q-2","impact":3,"impactReason":"Changes who can see and use templates.","options":["Private to the creating user","Shared with all users of the same customer company"],"reason":"Buyers already see everything their company does (Q-2), so sharing templates is consistent with that.","recommended":"Shared with all users of the same customer company","score":6,"spans":["I-15"],"text":"Saved basket templates: private to the buyer who made them, or shared with everyone in the company?","uncertainty":2},{"category":"roles","id":"Q-3","impact":3,"impactReason":"Controls access and ordering.","options":["Its users can't sign in until the company is reactivated; history is kept","Users can sign in and view history but can't place orders","Only new orders by staff are blocked"],"reason":"This matches how deactivating a user already works.","recommended":"Its users can't sign in until the company is reactivated; history is kept","score":6,"spans":["I-9","I-17"],"text":"A customer company is set to inactive. What happens to its users?","uncertainty":2},{"category":"scope","id":"Q-4","impact":3,"impactReason":"Decides which orders can be placed.","options":["Yes: stock is shown only as information (stock is only updated nightly), and staff deal with shortfalls at confirmation","No: the basket blocks quantities above the imported stock"],"reason":"Stock is only updated nightly, so blocking orders would turn away orders based on old figures. Staff already review every order.","recommended":"Yes: stock is shown only as information (stock is only updated nightly), and staff deal with shortfalls at confirmation","score":6,"spans":["45-erp-stock-integration","67-business-rules-summary"],"text":"Can customers order more than the stock shown, or order out-of-stock products?","uncertainty":2},{"category":"scope","id":"Q-5","impact":3,"impactReason":"Changes order states and triggers customer emails.","options":["Only before it is Confirmed, the same as editing","Any time before Out for Delivery","Any time before Delivered"],"reason":"Uses the same cut-off as customer cancellation and staff editing.","recommended":"Only before it is Confirmed, the same as editing","score":6,"spans":["58-order-lifecycle","43-notifications"],"text":"Up to what point can staff reject or cancel an order?","uncertainty":2},{"category":"roles","id":"Q-6","impact":3,"impactReason":"Controls who sees sensitive change history and how long data is kept.","options":["Admins only, on the Audit history screen; kept for 7 years like orders","Admins only; kept forever","Admins and staff; kept for 7 years"],"reason":"The audit screen is listed only under admin screens, and this reuses the existing 7-year rule.","recommended":"Admins only, on the Audit history screen; kept for 7 years like orders","score":6,"spans":["42-audit-history","57-main-admin-screens"],"text":"Who can see the audit history, and how long is it kept?","topic":"audit","uncertainty":2},{"category":"scope","id":"Q-7","impact":3,"impactReason":"It changes order state and who is allowed to change it.","options":["Customer users and Staff can cancel until the order is dispatched; after that only Staff can","Customer users can cancel only before Staff start processing it; Staff can cancel until dispatch","Only Staff and Admin can cancel orders"],"reason":"Without amendments, cancel-and-reorder is the only way to fix an order, so customers need a safe window to do it.","recommended":"Customer users can cancel only before Staff start processing it; Staff can cancel until dispatch","score":6,"spans":[],"text":"Orders can't be amended, but cancellation is in scope. Who can cancel an order, and up to which point?","uncertainty":2},{"category":"roles","id":"Q-8","impact":3,"impactReason":"It sets permissions on pricing, product data and user data.","options":["Admin only: products, price lists, staff/admin users and the audit view. Staff: orders, customers and customer users","Admin only: audit view and staff/admin users. Staff can also manage products and price lists","Staff and Admin are the same except for the audit view"],"reason":"This follows the separate 'Staff experience' and 'Admin experience' items and matches earlier answers: staff create customer accounts, and audit is admin-only.","recommended":"Admin only: products, price lists, staff/admin users and the audit view. Staff: orders, customers and customer users","score":6,"spans":[],"text":"What can Admin do that Staff cannot?","topic":"roles","uncertainty":2},{"category":"data-model","id":"Q-9","impact":3,"impactReason":"It decides who can write money-related data and what customers see on their invoices.","options":["Staff and Admin set it on each invoice: Unpaid / Paid","Staff and Admin set it on each invoice: Unpaid / Part-paid / Paid / Overdue","Only Admin sets it on each invoice: Unpaid / Paid","Set on the order rather than the invoice: Unpaid / Paid"],"reason":"This is the smallest manual tracking that still matches the 'Payment status' scope item.","recommended":"Staff and Admin set it on each invoice: Unpaid / Paid","score":6,"spans":[],"text":"Payment status is tracked by hand. Who changes it, and what values can it have?","uncertainty":2}],"assumptions":[{"fromQuestion":"Q-1","fromSpan":["I-5","I-16"],"id":"ASM-1","risk":"low","text":"Invoices are only created when an order becomes Delivered. In the customer's invoice list, should we just show every invoice that exists (so effectively only delivered orders), or also show placeholder or pro-forma entries for orders that haven't been delivered yet? → assumed: List all existing invoices (created at Delivered) with payment status; no placeholders for undelivered orders"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-2","fromSpan":["I-3","I-11","I-10"],"id":"ASM-2","risk":"high","text":"What happens to a product that is active in the catalogue but has no price on the customer's assigned price list? → assumed: Visible but shown as 'price on request' and cannot be added to the basket"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-3","fromSpan":["I-13","I-11"],"id":"ASM-3","risk":"high","text":"At checkout, the price check finds that a price changed after the item went into the basket. What happens? → assumed: Update the basket to the current price, show the customer what changed, and require them to confirm again before submitting"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-9","fromSpan":["I-3","I-12","I-13"],"id":"ASM-4","risk":"high","text":"What does the out-of-stock check at checkout block? → assumed: Only products whose status is Out of stock; quantity is not checked against imported stock"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-10","fromSpan":["I-12"],"id":"ASM-5","risk":"low","text":"How does the nightly ERP stock CSV reach the portal, and what format is it in? → assumed: The ERP drops the file into a configured folder or SFTP location that the import job reads; the columns are agreed with the client"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-11","fromSpan":["I-12"],"id":"ASM-6","risk":"high","text":"A stock file is otherwise valid, but some rows have unknown product codes, and some active products are missing from the file. How should the import treat these? → assumed: Skip unknown rows and log them; products missing from the file keep their previous stock"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-12","fromSpan":["I-12","I-3"],"id":"ASM-7","risk":"low","text":"How is the Low stock threshold defined? → assumed: One system-wide quantity set by admins in system settings"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-13","fromSpan":["I-13"],"id":"ASM-8","risk":"low","text":"Which timezone and which non-working days apply to the 14:00 cutoff and working-day calculations? → assumed: One configured business timezone, with admins keeping a list of non-working dates (public holidays included) as well as weekends"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-14","fromSpan":["I-13"],"id":"ASM-9","risk":"low","text":"How far ahead can a customer choose a delivery date? → assumed: Any working day from the earliest available date up to a configurable number of days ahead (e.g. 30)"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-15","fromSpan":["I-11","I-16"],"id":"ASM-10","risk":"high","text":"Do prices include tax, and do order and invoice totals show tax? → assumed: Prices are entered and shown excluding tax; no tax is calculated in this phase"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-17","fromSpan":["I-13"],"id":"ASM-11","risk":"low","text":"Should a basket be kept between sign-ins? → assumed: Yes: one saved basket per user, kept until checkout or cleared"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-19","fromSpan":["I-14"],"id":"ASM-12","risk":"low","text":"How should staff rejections be recorded? → assumed: Use Cancelled status with a required rejection reason, marked as staff-rejected in the timeline"},{"fromDefault":"notifications","fromQuestion":"Q-20","fromSpan":["I-14","I-5"],"id":"ASM-13","risk":"low","text":"Who gets order emails (confirmation, amendment, rejection, out for delivery), including for orders staff create? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-21","fromSpan":["I-14","I-16"],"id":"ASM-14","risk":"low","text":"How are order and invoice numbers formatted? → assumed: Separate sequential numbers with a configurable prefix (e.g. ORD-000123, INV-000123)"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-22","fromSpan":["I-11","I-17"],"id":"ASM-15","risk":"high","text":"An admin deactivates a price list that customers are still assigned to. What happens? → assumed: Block deactivation while any active customer is assigned to it"},{"fromDefault":"roles","fromQuestion":"Q-24","fromSpan":["I-6","I-17"],"id":"ASM-16","risk":"high","text":"Can Administrators also do everything Office Staff can (order queue, confirming orders, invoices)? → assumed: Two roles: an administrator and a standard user."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-25","fromSpan":["I-9"],"id":"ASM-17","risk":"low","text":"How should password reset links and invitations expire, and can invitations be resent? → assumed: Reset link valid 1 hour, invitation 7 days (both configurable); admins can resend, which cancels the earlier invitation"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-26","fromSpan":["I-9"],"id":"ASM-18","risk":"low","text":"Can a user whose account is locked request a password reset, and does completing the reset unlock the account? → assumed: Yes: they can request a reset, and completing it clears the lock"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-27","fromSpan":["I-10","I-17"],"id":"ASM-19","risk":"low","text":"Do categories need to be nested? → assumed: One flat level of categories"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-28","fromSpan":["I-10","I-2"],"id":"ASM-20","risk":"low","text":"Where does vehicle compatibility data come from? → assumed: Admins enter it by hand for each product (make/model/year/engine/variant)"},{"fromDefault":"search","fromQuestion":"Q-29","fromSpan":["I-2","I-10"],"id":"ASM-21","risk":"low","text":"How should catalogue search match and rank results? → assumed: Search by name or title with simple filters; no full-text search engine."},{"fromDefault":"reporting","fromQuestion":"Q-30","fromSpan":["I-7"],"id":"ASM-22","risk":"low","text":"What should the basic sales and product reports contain? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-31","fromSpan":["I-6"],"id":"ASM-23","risk":"low","text":"Which orders go into 'the day's delivery list' export? → assumed: Orders with today's delivery date (or a chosen date) in Confirmed, Picking or Out for delivery status"},{"fromDefault":"languages","fromQuestion":"Q-32","fromSpan":["I-1"],"id":"ASM-24","risk":"low","text":"Which languages and currency does the portal support? → assumed: English only, left to right."},{"fromDefault":"sign-in","fromQuestion":"Q-4","fromSpan":["52-error-handling","49-security"],"id":"ASM-25","risk":"low","text":"When a sign-in fails, what should the message say? → assumed: Email and password, with a reset link by email; no social or single sign-on."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-5","fromSpan":["54-loading-states","71-testing-requirements"],"id":"ASM-26","risk":"high","text":"How should the system stop the same order being submitted twice? → assumed: Disable the submit button and show a loading state while the order is being sent"},{"fromDefault":"sign-in","fromQuestion":"Q-6","fromSpan":["55-main-customer-screens","56-main-staff-screens"],"id":"ASM-27","risk":"low","text":"Is staff sign-in a separate page, or do staff use the same sign-in as customers? → assumed: Email and password, with a reset link by email; no social or single sign-on."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-9","fromSpan":["64-pdf-generation","63-file-storage"],"id":"ASM-28","risk":"low","text":"Is the invoice PDF made once and stored, or made again on every download? → assumed: Made once after the invoice is created, stored, and the same file served on every download"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-10","fromSpan":["58-order-lifecycle","59-invoice-lifecycle"],"id":"ASM-29","risk":"high","text":"Section 58 shows 'Invoice Created' as a step after Delivered. Is it an order status? → assumed: No: the order ends at Delivered, and the invoice is a separate record with its own status"},{"fromDefault":"reporting","fromQuestion":"Q-11","fromSpan":["39-reporting"],"id":"ASM-30","risk":"low","text":"What counts as revenue and order value in the reports? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder."},{"fromDefault":"reporting","fromQuestion":"Q-12","fromSpan":["39-reporting","40-report-filters"],"id":"ASM-31","risk":"low","text":"Which date decides whether an order falls inside the report's date range? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder."},{"fromDefault":"roles","fromQuestion":"Q-14","fromSpan":["50-data-isolation","67-business-rules-summary"],"id":"ASM-32","risk":"high","text":"Can buyers at the same company see each other's orders, invoices and templates? → assumed: Two roles: an administrator and a standard user."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-16","fromSpan":["71-testing-requirements"],"id":"ASM-33","risk":"low","text":"What does 'low stock' mean? → assumed: One configurable threshold quantity for all products"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-17","fromSpan":["45-erp-stock-integration","62-background-jobs"],"id":"ASM-34","risk":"high","text":"How does the nightly ERP stock file reach the portal? → assumed: A scheduled job reads the newest file from a configured location (folder or SFTP) at a configured time"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-18","fromSpan":["65-csv-import-requirements","45-erp-stock-integration"],"id":"ASM-35","risk":"high","text":"If some rows in the stock file are invalid, what happens to the rest of the file? → assumed: Valid rows are imported, invalid rows are rejected and listed in the import result on the System/import status screen"},{"fromDefault":"notifications","fromQuestion":"Q-19","fromSpan":["43-notifications","44-email-provider"],"id":"ASM-36","risk":"low","text":"The email provider is not known yet. How should sending be built? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push."},{"fromDefault":"notifications","fromQuestion":"Q-20","fromSpan":["52-error-handling","62-background-jobs"],"id":"ASM-37","risk":"low","text":"What happens when an email fails to send? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push."},{"fromQuestion":"Q-21","fromSpan":["72-acceptance-criteria-examples","67-business-rules-summary"],"id":"ASM-38","risk":"low","text":"How are working days, public holidays and the 14:00 cut-off set? → assumed: Monday to Friday are working days; the cut-off time and a list of holiday dates are kept in configuration"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-23","fromSpan":["59-invoice-lifecycle"],"id":"ASM-39","risk":"low","text":"What should the payment term setting default to? → assumed: 30 days"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-24","fromSpan":["64-pdf-generation"],"id":"ASM-40","risk":"high","text":"Who gives invoices their numbers? → assumed: The portal gives each invoice the next number in one sequence"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-25","fromSpan":["64-pdf-generation","39-reporting"],"id":"ASM-41","risk":"high","text":"How is tax (VAT) handled on prices and invoices? → assumed: Prices are stored without tax, and invoices add VAT at one configurable rate"},{"fromQuestion":"Q-26","fromSpan":["59-invoice-lifecycle","42-audit-history"],"id":"ASM-42","risk":"high","text":"Can a 'paid' mark on an invoice be undone if it was made by mistake? → assumed: Yes: staff can set it back to Unpaid, which clears the payment details