tly one company"},{"fromDefault":"sign-in","fromQuestion":"Q-10","fromSpan":[],"id":"ASM-51","risk":"low","text":"Users sign in with email and password on accounts that Staff or Admin create. How do they set their first password and reset a forgotten one? → assumed: Email and password, with a reset link by email; no social or single sign-on."},{"fromDefault":"audit","fromQuestion":"Q-11","fromSpan":[],"id":"ASM-52","risk":"low","text":"How long are audit-history entries kept? → assumed: Who created and last changed each record, and when; no full audit trail."}],"conflicts":["Section 58 shows 'Invoice Created' as a step in the order lifecycle, but section 59 gives invoices their own lifecycle.","Section 46 talks about 'deleting a user', but rule 15 and the audit events mention only deactivation.","Section 62 lists 'invoice overdue status updates' as a background job, but answer Q-2 says Overdue is worked out when the invoice is viewed.","Section 62 lists invoice generation as a background job, but answer Q-4 and section 72 say the invoice is created in the same save as the Delivered status change."],"differences":[],"round":2}